npm warn exec The following package was not found and will be installed: playwright@1.64.0
Usage: npx playwright show-trace [options] [trace]

show trace viewer

Options:
  -b, --browser <browserType>  browser to use, one of cr, chromium, ff, firefox,
                               wk, webkit (default: "chromium")
  -h, --host <host>            Host to serve trace on; specifying this option
                               opens trace in a browser tab
  -p, --port <port>            Port to serve trace on, 0 for any free port;
                               specifying this option opens trace in a browser
                               tab
  --stdin                      Accept trace URLs over stdin to update the viewer
  --help                       display help for command

  Examples:

    $ show-trace
    $ show-trace https://example.com/trace.zip
